) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਨਾ ਹੀ (ਉਹ) ਹਥਿਆਰ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਗੱਜੇ।"}}},{"verse_id":77588,"page_no":65,"line_no":77588,"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਹਾਰਿ ਨਾਰਿ ਲੱਜਹੀਂ ॥੮॥","translit_en":"nihaar naar la'jahee(n) ||8||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"They did not shout loudly like valiant heroes and felt Ashamed on seeing ladies.8."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਉਨ੍ਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਨਾਰੀਆਂ ਵੀ ਸ਼ਰਮਾਉਣ ਲਗੀਆਂ ॥੮॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":7533,"next":7535}}